message: "If you use this repository, please cite the accompanying final-year project report."
title: "PV Impedance Condition Monitoring"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Langeveldt
    given-names: Jamie
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jamielng26/pv-impedance-condition-monitoring"
url: "https://github.com/Jamielng26/pv-impedance-condition-monitoring"
abstract: >-
  Experimental data and MATLAB analysis supporting a final-year project on
  impedance-based fault classification and condition monitoring of a
  photovoltaic module under healthy operating variation, partial shading,
  mismatch and exploratory local heating.
keywords:
  - photovoltaic
  - impedance spectroscopy
  - frequency response analysis
  - partial shading
  - condition monitoring
  - fault classification
